career! Sign up for Career Academy either by attending any of the workshops listed below, or using the link and selecting \"Join\" through ExperienceWMU. Sign up for Career Academy Career Academy workshops are not offered during the summer and will begin in September 2026. Need help crafting a winning resume? Learn the basics of resume writing, including the standard chronological format and how to best highlight your accomplishments. Upcoming Resume 1.0 Workshops Ready to find your next gig? Discover effective job search strategies, leverage Handshake, and learn the importance of networking to land your dream job. Upcoming Job Search Basics Workshops Want to ace your next job interview? Learn the STAR method for answering tough questions, craft a memorable introduction, and discover tips that will help you stand out from the competition. Upcoming Interviewing Workshops Ready to make a splash at a job fair? Explore career resources, research potential employers, and create a personalized strategy maximize your experience. Upcoming Job Fair Prep Workshops Footer menu Audiences Alumni and Donors Businesses Veterans Locations Grand Rapids Kalamazoo Online Education Stryker School of Medicine Services Accessibility Campus Safety Information and Resources Human Resources Maps Parking Western Michigan University Kalamazoo MI 49008-5200 USA (269) 387-1000 Contact WMU WMU Notice of Non-Discrimination Land Acknowledgment Statement © 2026 All rights reserved. Social"
